### Adding New Tools

Example: Add a database query tool

```python
# In tools/execution_tools.py

async def query_database(
    query: str,
    database: str = "default",
    params: Optional[Dict[str, Any]] = None
) -> Dict[str, Any]:
    """Execute a database query."""
    # Implementation here
    pass

# Add to get_execution_tools()
{
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "query_database",
        "description": "Execute a SQL query",
        "parameters": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "query": {"type": "string"},
                "database": {"type": "string"},
                "params": {"type": "object"}
            },
            "required": ["query"]
        }
    },
    "callable": query_database
}
```

